OL,3,GNEWSA'Visual symbol' of town restored
OL,4,Aand back in place
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "very visual symbol" of Spalding's
OL,7,Fhistory is back on a museum rooftop
OL,8,Fafter 150 hours of restoration.
OL,10,FDating back to 1810, the weathervane,
OL,11,Fmostly made of copper, depicts a
OL,12,Fthree-masted seagoing vessel.
OL,14,FIt was placed back onto Spalding
OL,15,FGentlemen's Society museum roof on
OL,16,FBroad Street on 4 November after it was
OL,17,Frefurbished by one of the museum's
OL,18,Fmembers, Robert Frost.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,387,380,200,160,0,100
