OL,3,GNEWSA'Visual symbol' of town restored
OL,4,Aand back in place
OL,5,
OL,6,FDustin Frazier Wood, head of
OL,7,Fcollections and operations at the
OL,8,Fsociety said: "That ship really
OL,9,Frepresented a very long, hundreds of
OL,10,Fyears history of shipping in Spalding
OL,11,Fand its connections with the world."
